ovided and DoNotInvoice was set to false | Charge with DoNotInvoice cannot be set if DoNotInvoiceReasonListItem has a value. |\r\n| RelatedPONumberGuid supplied belongs to a deleted PONumber | Failed to save/update Charge because the supplied PONumber is not valid. The update has been rejected. Change the RelatedPONumberGuid to the Guid of a valid and undeleted PONumber |\r\n| PONumber supplied is longer than 120 characters | Charge has the property PONumber with value of {value} that is not supported. PONumber should not be longer than 120 characters |",
